<title>USA: Alternative Living to buy Wisc. properties.</title>
<headline>Alternative Living to buy Wisc. properties.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Living Services Inc said Monday it agreed to acquire four assisted- living facilities in Wisconsin for $5.5 million in cash. The transaction is scheduled to close on or before December 6, 1996, the assisted-living facility operator said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
